@UserManagementAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095
# Set Authentication__BearerToken before starting the API and use the same value below.
@token = <un-token-nuevo-y-aleatorio>
@userId = b7af0d35-f30c-4eef-8c27-521669e6940f
@missingUserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Reject a missing token (401)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

###

### Reject an invalid token (401)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token
Accept: application/json

###

### List users
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a user (copy the returned ID into @userId for the following requests)
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Morgan",
  "email": "alex.morgan@techhive.example",
  "department": "IT"
}

###

### Reject invalid input (400)
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "department": ""
}

###

### Reject a null request body (400)
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

null

###

### Return 404 for a user that does not exist
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{missingUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Retrieve a user by ID
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Update a user
PUT {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Morgan",
  "email": "alex.morgan@techhive.example",
  "department": "Human Resources"
}

###

### Return 404 when updating a user that does not exist
PUT {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{missingUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Morgan",
  "email": "alex.morgan@techhive.example",
  "department": "IT"
}

###

### Delete a user
DELETE {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Return 404 when deleting a user that does not exist
DELETE {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{missingUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Return a consistent 500 error (Development only)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/diagnostics/exception
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
